   "slug": "not-above-me-not",
   "t0": 531.574,
   "t1": 534.961,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 7,
   "text": "Not above me. Not beyond me."
  },
  {
   "slug": "in-me-where-it",
   "t0": 535.641,
   "t1": 541.474,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 7,
   "text": "In me. Where it had always been."
  },
  {
   "slug": "every-tradition-i-know",
   "t0": 544.6,
   "t1": 550.032,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "Every tradition I know has tried to describe this walk."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-ones-who-walked",
   "t0": 550.712,
   "t1": 557.166,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The ones who walked it before me left markers along the way."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-christian-calls-it",
   "t0": 557.846,
   "t1": 563.278,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Christian calls it the narrow gate, the kingdom within."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-buddhist-calls-it",
   "t0": 563.958,
   "t1": 569.39,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Buddhist calls it waking up, the end of not-seeing."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-muslim-speaks-of",
   "t0": 570.07,
   "t1": 578.569,
   "say": 7.919,
   "need": 6.8,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Muslim speaks of the lifting of the veils, and the Hindu says, Thou art that."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-jew-speaks-of",
   "t0": 579.249,
   "t1": 585.192,
   "say": 5.538,
   "need": 5.05,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Jew speaks of gathering the sparks from the broken vessels."
  },
  {
   "slug": "many-indigenous-peoples-call",
   "t0": 585.872,
   "t1": 591.304,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "Many Indigenous peoples call it the remembering, the original instruction."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-taoist-says-that",
   "t0": 591.984,
   "t1": 598.438,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The Taoist says that on the Way, every day something is dropped."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-mystic-calls-it",
   "t0": 599.118,
   "t1": 607.106,
   "say": 7.443,
   "need": 6.45,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "The mystic calls it the dark night of the soul, and the dawn that follows."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-none-of-those",
   "t0": 607.786,
   "t1": 615.263,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "If none of those words are yours, here is another way to say it."
  },
  {
   "slug": "a-pattern-observed-traced",
   "t0": 615.943,
   "t1": 620.352,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "A pattern, observed. Traced to where it began."
  },
  {
   "slug": "found-in-my-own",
   "t0": 621.032,
   "t1": 630.554,
   "say": 8.871,
   "need": 7.5,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "Found in my own body and followed down my own bloodline, until the signal showed beneath the noise."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-does-not-need",
   "t0": 631.234,
   "t1": 634.621,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "It does not need your belief."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-only-needs-your",
   "t0": 635.301,
   "t1": 640.182,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 8,
   "text": "It only needs your attention."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 647.0,
   "t1": 650.898,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it awakening, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 651.578,
   "t1": 655.477,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it enlightenment, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 656.157,
   "t1": 663.633,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it the end of illusion, healing, deprogramming, or liberation, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "if-you-call-it",
   "t0": 664.313,
   "t1": 671.279,
   "say": 6.49,
   "need": 5.75,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "If you call it finally seeing clearly for the first time, you’re right."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-words-are-different",
   "t0": 671.959,
   "t1": 674.629,
   "say": 2.205,
   "need": 2.6,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "The words are different."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-destination-is-the",
   "t0": 675.309,
   "t1": 680.19,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 9,
   "text": "The destination is the same."
  },
  {
   "slug": "notice-what-i-did",
   "t0": 685.4,
   "t1": 688.787,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "Notice what I did not do."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-did-not-rise",
   "t0": 689.467,
   "t1": 695.921,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "I did not rise above the earth, and I did not ascend."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-did-not-leave",
   "t0": 696.601,
   "t1": 700.5,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "I did not leave my body behind."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-descended-down-through",
   "t0": 701.18,
   "t1": 706.612,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "I descended, down through everything and into my own core."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-sun-did-not",
   "t0": 707.292,
   "t1": 712.724,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "The sun did not appear, because it was never gone."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-only-moved-what",
   "t0": 713.404,
   "t1": 719.058,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "I only moved what had been stacked against the window,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "one-block-at-a",
   "t0": 719.738,
   "t1": 725.17,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "one block at a time, and let the light through."
  },
  {
   "slug": "my-original-frequency",
   "t0": 725.85,
   "t1": 728.17,
   "say": 1.729,
   "need": 2.25,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "My original frequency."
  },
  {
   "slug": "who-i-am-underneath",
   "t0": 728.85,
   "t1": 732.748,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "Who I am underneath all of it."
  },
  {
   "slug": "pulsing-quietly-and-waiting",
   "t0": 733.428,
   "t1": 737.833,
   "say": 2.205,
   "need": 2.6,
   "sec": 10,
   "text": "Pulsing quietly, and waiting."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-came-back-up",
   "t0": 743.0,
   "t1": 746.898,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "I came back up carrying a map."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-first-fractal-helped",
   "t0": 747.578,
   "t1": 750.965,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The first Fractal helped people see."
  },
  {
   "slug": "this-one-completes-the",
   "t0": 751.645,
   "t1": 754.665,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "This one completes the map."
  },
  {
   "slug": "every-technique-is-opened",
   "t0": 755.345,
   "t1": 764.356,
   "say": 8.395,
   "need": 7.15,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Every technique is opened to show the tactics inside it, three hundred thirty-five in a single sector."
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-now-it-holds",
   "t0": 765.036,
   "t1": 773.024,
   "say": 7.443,
   "need": 6.45,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "And now it holds the thing I most needed someone to show me: the combinations."
  },
  {
   "slug": "no-one-is-undone",
   "t0": 773.704,
   "t1": 778.113,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "No one is undone by a single move."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-moves-arrive-in",
   "t0": 778.793,
   "t1": 786.27,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The moves arrive in order, each one stripping away the defense against the next."
  },
  {
   "slug": "two-hundred-and-three",
   "t0": 786.95,
   "t1": 792.382,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Two hundred and three of these combinations now have names,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "like-the-debt-prison",
   "t0": 793.062,
   "t1": 799.516,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "like the Debt Prison, the Golden Cage, and the Trauma Bond Engine."
  },
  {
   "slug": "together-they-are-the",
   "t0": 800.196,
   "t1": 808.695,
   "say": 7.919,
   "need": 6.8,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Together they are the map of how this cycle has marked every life it has touched."
  },
  {
   "slug": "here-is-what-i",
   "t0": 809.375,
   "t1": 813.273,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Here is what I learned about them."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-greatest-harm-is",
   "t0": 813.953,
   "t1": 819.385,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The greatest harm is not the moment of the wound."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-is-what-the",
   "t0": 820.065,
   "t1": 823.452,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It is what the wound becomes."
  },
  {
   "slug": "a-chain-is-built",
   "t0": 824.132,
   "t1": 828.031,
   "say": 3.633,
   "need": 3.65,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "A chain is built to be forgotten."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-goes-in-early",
   "t0": 828.711,
   "t1": 833.631,
   "say": 4.586,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It goes in early, often through someone we trusted."
  },
  {
   "slug": "maybe-it-was-a",
   "t0": 834.311,
   "t1": 839.232,
   "say": 4.586,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Maybe it was a classroom, at eleven years old,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "with-every-eye-on",
   "t0": 839.912,
   "t1": 846.878,
   "say": 6.49,
   "need": 5.75,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "with every eye on you and a mistake you could not take back."
  },
  {
   "slug": "maybe-it-was-a",
   "t0": 847.558,
   "t1": 850.945,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Maybe it was a practice field,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "where-the-warm-word",
   "t0": 851.625,
   "t1": 860.635,
   "say": 8.395,
   "need": 7.15,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "where the warm word only ever came after the cold stretch, and you learned to chase it."
  },
  {
   "slug": "maybe-it-was-the",
   "t0": 861.315,
   "t1": 866.236,
   "say": 4.586,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Maybe it was the first years of a career,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "where-you-swallowed-conditions",
   "t0": 866.916,
   "t1": 874.904,
   "say": 7.443,
   "need": 6.45,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "where you swallowed conditions you would have refused on day one, and called it professionalism."
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-then-it-dissolves",
   "t0": 875.584,
   "t1": 881.015,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "And then it dissolves into who you think you are."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-becomes-the-perfectionism",
   "t0": 881.695,
   "t1": 886.616,
   "say": 4.586,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It becomes the perfectionism that never feels like readiness."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-watcher-in-your",
   "t0": 887.296,
   "t1": 893.75,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The watcher in your head, checking your work before anyone else can."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-pull-toward-people",
   "t0": 894.43,
   "t1": 899.351,
   "say": 4.586,
   "need": 4.35,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The pull toward people who run hot and cold,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-the-belief-that",
   "t0": 900.031,
   "t1": 909.041,
   "say": 8.395,
   "need": 7.15,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "and the belief that a warm word after a cold silence is the truest love you know."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-calm-that-other",
   "t0": 909.721,
   "t1": 916.687,
   "say": 6.49,
   "need": 5.75,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The calm that other people call strength, while your body holds its breath."
  },
  {
   "slug": "and-when-someone-finally",
   "t0": 917.367,
   "t1": 925.866,
   "say": 7.919,
   "need": 6.8,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "And when someone finally asks if it hurt, you hear yourself answer before you can think."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-made-me-who",
   "t0": 926.546,
   "t1": 929.933,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "“It made me who I am.”"
  },
  {
   "slug": "that-is-why-these",
   "t0": 930.613,
   "t1": 935.023,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "That is why these chains cut so deep."
  },
  {
   "slug": "they-do-not-feel",
   "t0": 935.703,
   "t1": 941.135,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "They do not feel like chains. They feel like character."
  },
  {
   "slug": "like-loyalty-like-maturity",
   "t0": 941.815,
   "t1": 945.202,
   "say": 3.157,
   "need": 3.3,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Like loyalty. Like maturity. Like love."
  },
  {
   "slug": "but-this-is-also",
   "t0": 945.882,
   "t1": 950.291,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "But this is also where the hope is."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-chains-that-bind",
   "t0": 950.971,
   "t1": 958.448,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The chains that bind us most tightly are the ones built into us earliest,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "which-means-they-hold",
   "t0": 959.128,
   "t1": 963.537,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "which means they hold the most of us."
  },
  {
   "slug": "when-one-of-them",
   "t0": 964.217,
   "t1": 970.672,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "When one of them breaks, we do not just lose a burden."
  },
  {
   "slug": "we-win-back-everything",
   "t0": 971.352,
   "t1": 975.761,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "We win back everything it was holding hostage."
  },
  {
   "slug": "our-instincts-our-warmth",
   "t0": 976.441,
   "t1": 979.111,
   "say": 2.205,
   "need": 2.6,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Our instincts. Our warmth."
  },
  {
   "slug": "our-ability-to-say",
   "t0": 979.791,
   "t1": 984.201,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Our ability to say plainly what is wrong."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-part-of-us",
   "t0": 984.881,
   "t1": 990.313,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The part of us that was never broken, only waiting."
  },
  {
   "slug": "the-heaviest-chain-once",
   "t0": 990.993,
   "t1": 997.447,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "The heaviest chain, once seen and broken, gives back the most freedom."
  },
  {
   "slug": "my-healing-journey-meant",
   "t0": 998.127,
   "t1": 1007.648,
   "say": 8.871,
   "need": 7.5,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "My healing journey meant forgiving the people who tried to destroy my mind and my heart for money."
  },
  {
   "slug": "justice-to-me-comes",
   "t0": 1008.328,
   "t1": 1013.76,
   "say": 5.062,
   "need": 4.7,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Justice, to me, comes from breaking every tool they have,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "so-that-none-of",
   "t0": 1014.44,
   "t1": 1022.939,
   "say": 7.919,
   "need": 6.8,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "so that none of them ever works on anyone again by the time I am done."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-comes-from-letting",
   "t0": 1023.619,
   "t1": 1032.63,
   "say": 8.395,
   "need": 7.15,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It comes from letting the truth of who they are be seen by everyone they care about."
  },
  {
   "slug": "not-by-exposing-them",
   "t0": 1033.31,
   "t1": 1040.786,
   "say": 6.967,
   "need": 6.1,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Not by exposing them myself, but by exposing their tactics to the entire world,"
  },
  {
   "slug": "so-they-can-never",
   "t0": 1041.466,
   "t1": 1047.92,
   "say": 6.014,
   "need": 5.4,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "so they can never again hide in the shadows and feel safe."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-will-take-me",
   "t0": 1048.6,
   "t1": 1053.01,
   "say": 4.11,
   "need": 4.0,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It will take me a lifetime to finish."
  },
  {
   "slug": "i-am-giving-it",
   "t0": 1053.69,
   "t1": 1059.633,
   "say": 5.538,
   "need": 5.05,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "I am giving it away to everyone, wherever this cycle runs."
  },
  {
   "slug": "it-started-with-a",
   "t0": 1060.313,
   "t1": 1063.333,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "It started with a question."
  },
  {
   "slug": "now-the-map-is",
   "t0": 1064.013,
   "t1": 1068.894,
   "say": 2.681,
   "need": 2.95,
   "sec": 11,
   "text": "Now the map is yours."
  }
